    "overview": "The question bank reads as an edition of the Python documentation: questions are entries, answering is evaluating. White page, near-black text, Python blue for ink, links and the index, hairline rules, a 3px radius, no in-page shadows. Dark theme is docs dark mode with the same roles.",
